      "spam": false,
      "value": "I've noticed for larger avatars though, that ball does seem to scale up, and I've made some really large avatars, and it's still large enough to view.  I guess it is not the same for the reverse, or the scaling isn't 1:1   if this is the case, I would agree, it should be fixed.",
